    "Id": "chassisdef_wraith_WRT-TR4-X",
    "Name": "Wraith",
    "Details": "The Wraith TR4-X was the first produced variant of the new \"Wing\" line of the chassis. Based of the TR2-X 'Alexander' arena fighter, it proved that the partial wing could work on a mass-produced chassis as well. The major weakness of the 'Mech was its weak damage potential, with only a Light PPC and one medium and one small ER laser.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Ubiquitous</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Wraith"
  },
