  },
  "StockRole": "Skirmisher & Cavalry",
  "YangsThoughts": "The \"Wing\"-series of the Wraith was introduced in the 3140s by Hellespont Industrials, with its main trait being the integration of a partial wings system into the chassis to increase the jump range considerably. The re-design introduced a number of other improvements as well, with the result that the new line of variants slightly more expensive to maintain.",
